---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftScopeInterface
---
Construct a ScopeInterface draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Inspect interfaces where one bidder excludes work as by others or assumes another trade provides prerequisites. Identify unowned functions and duplicated commitments, and distinguish acceptable overlap from double-charged or conflicting responsibility.
